    "recommendations": "Ensuring the single access point and extended driveway remain unobstructed at all times could significantly improve response times and support effective apparatus positioning at this property. Marking or clearly identifying the primary access point from the main road may assist responding units in locating the entry quickly. Given the limited rear access and presence of dense vegetation near structures, designating a forward staging area near the front driveway or vehicle parking area would support coordinated operations. Maintaining adequate clearance along the driveway corridor for two-way apparatus movement, where feasible, may enhance both ingress and egress during concurrent emergency operations."
